lend-color\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"container py-14 sm:py-20 lg:py-24\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"no-print\"><ol class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1 text-xs text-on-inverse/70\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><a class=\"hover:text-on-inverse\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-on-inverse/40\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg><span aria-current=\"page\" class=\"font-medium text-on-inverse\">About</span></li></ol></nav><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"http://localhost:3001/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"About\",\"item\":\"http://localhost:3001/restaurant/about\"}]}</script><div class=\"mt-6 max-w-3xl text-on-inverse\"><p class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-on-inverse/20 bg-on-inverse/10 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent-bright backdrop-blur\">About KitchenMath</p><h1 class=\"mt-5 text-[2.2rem] font-semibold leading-[1.06] text-on-inverse sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.4rem]\"><span class=\"text-accent-bright\">Most restaurants don&#x27;t fail on food. They fail on</span> <span class=\"font-serif font-normal italic\">numbers.</span></h1></div></div></section><div class=\"container max-w-4xl pb-16 pt-12\"><p class=\"mb-10 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">After commission, discounts, ads and GST, delivery-app orders can quietly lose money. A price copied from the dine-in menu or an untracked discount can turn a busy month into a loss. <!-- -->KitchenMath<!-- --> puts the key numbers in front of owners for free, without software subscriptions or sign-ups.</p><div class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-6 shadow-card\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Transparent maths</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Every calculator shows its formula, and every score shows how it was built. No black boxes.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-6 shadow-card\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Honest benchmarks</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Reference ranges are indicative, drawn from common industry practice. The right numbers for your outlet depend on format, city, cuisine and pricing. We label them as reference ranges, never as rules.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-6 shadow-card\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Private by default</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Calculations run in your browser. Saved scenarios stay on your device. There is no account and no tracking of the numbers you enter.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-6 shadow-card\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Built for Indian restaurants</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Rupees, lakh and crore formatting, GST on platform commission, and examples that match how Indian outlets operate.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-10 rounded-3xl bg-inverse p-6 text-on-inverse sm:p-8\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-on-inverse\">A note on estimates</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-on-inverse/75\">Results depend entirely on the numbers you enter and on simplified models. They are for planning and conversation, not financial, tax or legal advice. Check important decisions with your accountant.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl font-medium transition-all duration-150 active:scale-